---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Plombier Mouscron (7700) | Depannage Urgent 24/7 en 30 Min"
  description="Plombier a Mouscron en urgence disponible 24h/24 et 7j/7. Intervention en 30 minutes pour fuite d'eau, debouchage canalisation, boiler et WC. Devis gratuit avant travaux."
>
  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="relative bg-brand-navy text-white overflow-hidden py-14 lg:py-20" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#FF4304_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:20px_20px]"></div>
    <div class="absolute -right-24 -top-24 w-96 h-96 bg-brand-red/10 rounded-full blur-3xl pointer-events-none"></div>

    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <!-- Hero Left Column -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-7">
          <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-sm border border-white/15 text-xs font-semibold text-white mb-6">
            <span class="flex h-2 w-2 relative">
              <span class="animate-ping absolute inline-flex h-full w-full rounded-full bg-brand-red opacity-75"></span>
              <span class="relative inline-flex rounded-full h-2 w-2 bg-brand-red"></span>
            </span>
            <span class="text-amber-400 font-bold">Note 4.9/5</span>
            <span class="text-white/40">|</span>
            <span class="tracking-wide uppercase text-[11px]">Artisans Plombiers Agrees Mouscron</span>
          </div>

          <h1 id="hero-heading" class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight leading-tight sm:leading-none text-white mb-6">
            Plombier a <span class="text-brand-red">Mouscron</span> : Urgence 24/7
          </h1>

          <p class="text-lg sm:text-xl text-gray-300 font-body mb-6 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl">
            Fuite d'eau importante, WC bouche, canalisation qui refoule ou panne d'eau chaude ? Nos techniciens qualifies interviennent chez vous a Mouscron et environs en moins de 30 minutes.
          </p>

          <!-- Key Checkpoints -->
          <div class="space-y-3 mb-8">
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-200">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-red/20 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">OK</span>
              <span><strong>Arrivee en 30 a 45 minutes</strong> : Disponible 24h/24, 7j/7 et jours feries</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-200">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-red/20 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">OK</span>
              <span><strong>Tarif annonce avant intervention</strong> : Devis clair et sans frais caches</span>
            </div>
            <div class="flex items-center space-x-3 text-sm font-medium text-gray-200">
              <span class="flex-shrink-0 w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-red/20 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">OK</span>
              <span><strong>Agree assurances et SWDE</strong> : Rapport detaille pour degat des eaux</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- Hero Action Buttons -->
          <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4 mb-6">
            <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-8 py-4 rounded-xl bg-brand-red hover:bg-brand-redHover text-white text-base font-bold shadow-lg shadow-brand-red/30 transition transform hover:-translate-y-0.5" href="tel:+3256980244">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 mr-3" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
                <path d="M2 3a1 1 0 011-1h2.153a1 1 0 01.986.836l.74 4.435a1 1 0 01-.54 1.06l-1.548.773a11.037 11.037 0 006.105 6.105l.774-1.548a1 1 0 011.059-.54l4.435.74a1 1 0 01.836.986V17a1 1 0 01-1 1h-2C7.82 18 2 12.18 2 4V3z"></path>
              </svg>
              Appelez le 056 98 02 44
            </a>
            <a class="inline-flex items-center justify-center px-7 py-4 rounded-xl bg-white/10 hover:bg-white/20 text-white border border-white/20 text-base font-semibold backdrop-blur-sm transition" href="#devis-rapide">
              Demander un Devis Gratuit
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="text-xs text-gray-400">
            Plombiers bases a Mouscron (7700) : Luingne, Herseaux, Dottignies, Mont-a-Leux et Le Tuquet.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Hero Right Form Card -->
        <div class="lg:col-span-5" id="devis-rapide">
          <div class="bg-white text-brand-darkText rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border border-brand-border p-6 sm:p-8">
            <div class="mb-5">
              <span class="inline-block px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded text-[11px] font-extrabold uppercase tracking-wide bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red mb-2">
                Reponse sous 10 minutes
              </span>
              <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy">Demande d'Intervention Rapide</h2>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-xs sm:text-sm mt-1">Obtenez un prix ferme ou bloquez le passage d'une equipe.</p>
            </div>

            <form class="space-y-3.5" action="/contact" method="GET">
              <div>
                <label for="lead-name" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-brand-darkText mb-1 tracking-wider">Votre nom complet *</label>
                <input id="lead-name" name="name" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-border focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-red focus:border-brand-red text-sm transition" placeholder="Ex: Jean Dupont" required type="text" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="lead-phone" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-brand-darkText mb-1 tracking-wider">Numero de telephone *</label>
                <input id="lead-phone" name="phone" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border-2 border-brand-red/40 bg-red-50/20 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-red focus:border-brand-red text-sm font-semibold transition" placeholder="04XX XX XX XX" required type="tel" />
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="lead-service" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-brand-darkText mb-1 tracking-wider">Nature du probleme *</label>
                <select id="lead-service" name="service" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-border focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-red focus:border-brand-red text-sm transition" required>
                  <option value="" disabled selected>Selectionnez votre panne</option>
                  <option value="fuite">Fuite d'eau active ou tuyau perce</option>
                  <option value="wc">WC bouche ou refoulement sanitaire</option>
                  <option value="canalisation">Canalisation ou egout bouche</option>
                  <option value="boiler">Chauffe-eau ou boiler en panne (eau froide)</option>
                  <option value="recherche">Recherche de fuite non destructive</option>
                  <option value="autre">Autre travail de plomberie sanitaire</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label for="lead-city" class="block text-xs font-bold uppercase text-brand-darkText mb-1 tracking-wider">Commune ou quartier a Mouscron</label>
                <input id="lead-city" name="location" class="w-full px-3.5 py-2.5 rounded-lg border border-brand-border focus:ring-2 focus:ring-brand-red focus:border-brand-red text-sm transition" placeholder="Ex: Mouscron centre, Luingne, Herseaux..." type="text" />
              </div>
              <button class="w-full py-3.5 px-4 bg-brand-red hover:bg-brand-redHover text-white font-bold rounded-xl text-base shadow-lg transition duration-150 cursor-pointer" type="submit">
                Confirmer l'appel d'urgence
              </button>
            </form>

            <div class="mt-4 pt-4 border-t border-brand-border text-center space-y-1.5">
              <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted">
                Besoin d'une reponse immediate ? Appelez le <a class="font-bold text-brand-navy hover:text-brand-red underline" href="tel:+3256980244">056 98 02 44</a>
              </p>
              <p class="text-[11px] text-gray-400">
                Intervention sans frais de dossier caches. TVA 6% si batiment de plus de 10 ans.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem Triage Grid Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-surface border-b border-brand-border" aria-labelledby="services-overview">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-12">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-red mb-2 block">Nos Solutions Express</span>
        <h2 id="services-overview" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
          Pannes et Urgences Prises en Charge a Mouscron
        </h2>
        <p class="text-brand-muted mt-3 text-base">
          Nos vehicules d'astreinte sont equipes de tout le materiel de debouchage, soudure et remplacement de pieces d'origine.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
        <!-- Card 1: Fuites -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-fuite.jpg" 
                alt="Reparation de fuite d'eau urgente a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy"
                width="800"
                height="450"
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Urgence Eau 24/7
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-7">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2.5 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">
                Reparation de Fuite d'Eau
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Tuyau cuivre ou multicouche perce, fuite sous evier, robinet d'arret defaillant, suintement encastre. Colmatage immediat pour limiter les degats.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-2 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Localisation de fuite non destructive</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Attestation pour la SWDE si surconsommation</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Rapport detaille assurance degat des eaux</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 sm:px-7 sm:pb-7">
            <a class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-brand-red hover:underline" href="/services#fuite">
              En savoir plus sur les fuites &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 2: Debouchage -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-debouchage.jpg" 
                alt="Debouchage canalisation et WC a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy"
                width="800"
                height="450"
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Intervention 30 Min
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-7">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2.5 group-hover:text-brand-navy transition-colors">
                Debouchage Canalisation & WC
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Toilettes qui debordent, evier qui ne s'ecoule plus, odeurs d'egout ou sterput refoulant. Intervention avec furet mecanique et hydrocureuse.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-2 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Debouchage WC en moins de 45 minutes</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Hydrocurage haute pression pour collecteurs</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-navy font-bold">+</span> Inspection par camera video haute definition</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 sm:px-7 sm:pb-7">
            <a class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-brand-navy hover:underline" href="/services#debouchage">
              En savoir plus sur le debouchage &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>

        <!-- Card 3: Boiler -->
        <article class="bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden border border-brand-border shadow-xs hover:shadow-xl transition-all duration-300 group flex flex-col justify-between">
          <div>
            <div class="h-52 overflow-hidden bg-gray-100 relative">
              <img 
                src="/images/service-boiler.jpg" 
                alt="Depannage boiler et chauffe-eau a Mouscron" 
                class="w-full h-full object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" 
                loading="lazy"
                width="800"
                height="450"
              />
              <span class="absolute top-3 left-3 bg-brand-navy/90 backdrop-blur-xs text-white text-[11px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wider px-2.5 py-1 rounded-md border border-white/10">
                Eau Chaude Express
              </span>
            </div>
            <div class="p-6 sm:p-7">
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-2.5 group-hover:text-brand-red transition-colors">
                Depannage Boiler & Chauffe-Eau
              </h3>
              <p class="text-brand-muted text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
                Plus d'eau chaude, groupe de securite qui coule sans arret, boiler qui fait disjoncter le compteur. Reparation ou remplacement rapide.
              </p>
              <ul class="text-xs text-brand-darkText space-y-2 mb-6">
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Marques Bulex, Vaillant, Ariston, ACV</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Detartrage complet pour eau calcaire de Mouscron</li>
                <li class="flex items-center gap-2"><span class="text-brand-red font-bold">+</span> Remplacement thermostat et resistances de stock</li>
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="px-6 pb-6 sm:px-7 sm:pb-7">
            <a class="inline-flex items-center text-sm font-bold text-brand-red hover:underline" href="/services#boiler">
              En savoir plus sur les boilers &rarr;
            </a>
          </div>
        </article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Local Authority Comparison: Us vs Brokers -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-white" aria-labelledby="why-local-heading">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 items-center">
        <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-red block">La Proximite Fait la Difference</span>
          <h2 id="why-local-heading" class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
            Pourquoi Choisir un Vrai Plombier Local a Mouscron ?
          </h2>
          <p class="text-brand-muted text-base leading-relaxed">
            De nombreuses plateformes sur internet se presentent comme des plombiers a Mouscron alors qu'elles sont basees a Bruxelles ou en France. Elles envoient des sous-traitants inconnus qui facturent des frais de deplacement abusifs.
          </p>
          <div class="space-y-4 pt-2">
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">1</div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-sm">Vehicules d'astreinte reels a Mouscron</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-0.5">Nos equipes partent de Mouscron meme, ce qui garantit un delai d'arrivee de 30 a 45 minutes sans promesse imaginaire.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">2</div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-sm">Prix fixes et devis annonce a l'avance</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-0.5">Vous connaissez le tarif du deplacement et du diagnostic avant que le technicien ne se mette en route.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="p-4 rounded-xl border border-brand-border bg-brand-surface flex items-start gap-4">
              <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-brand-red/10 text-brand-red font-bold flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">3</div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-sm">Facture belge legale avec TVA 6%</h3>
                <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-0.5">Taux reduit de 6% pour habitations privees de plus de 10 ans, attestation delivree pour vos remboursements d'assurance.</p>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="lg:col-span-6 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
          <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-64 h-64 bg-brand-red/10 rounded-full blur-2xl"></div>
          <h3 class="text-2xl font-black mb-4">Notre Charte de Transparence</h3>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6">
            Ce que vous ne trouverez jamais sur nos factures :
          </p>
          <ul class="space-y-3.5 text-sm">
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-red/20 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">X</span>
              <span>Aucun supplement impromptu sans accord prealable signe</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-red/20 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">X</span>
              <span>Aucun forfait kilometre trompeur pour l'entite de Mouscron</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-red/20 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">X</span>
              <span>Aucune piece remplacee sans explication technique verifiable</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <span class="w-5 h-5 rounded-full bg-brand-red/20 text-brand-red flex items-center justify-center text-xs font-bold">X</span>
              <span>Aucun numero surtaxe : ligne locale 056 directe</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
            <div>
              <span class="text-xs text-gray-400 block">Numero d'appel prioritaire :</span>
              <span class="text-2xl font-black text-white">056 98 02 44</span>
            </div>
            <a href="tel:+3256980244" class="px-5 py-3 rounded-xl bg-brand-red hover:bg-brand-redHover font-bold text-sm text-white transition">
              Appeler un technicien
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Interactive Belgian Price Estimator Section -->
  <section class="py-16 bg-brand-surface border-t border-brand-border" aria-labelledby="estimator-heading">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="text-center mb-10">
        <span class="text-xs font-bold tracking-widest uppercase text-brand-red mb-2 block">Transparence Tarifaire</span>
        <h2 id="estimator-heading" class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy tracking-tight">
          Grille Tarifaire Indicative a Mouscron (2026)
        </h2>
        <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mt-2">
          Tarifs donnes a titre indicatif pour interventions courantes. Devis ecrit remis sur place avant toute reparation.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-md overflow-hidden">
        <div class="overflow-x-auto">
          <table class="w-full text-left text-sm">
            <thead class="bg-brand-navy text-white uppercase text-xs tracking-wider">
              <tr>
                <th class="py-4 px-6">Prestation de plomberie</th>
                <th class="py-4 px-6">Delai d'arrivee</th>
                <th class="py-4 px-6">Tarif indicatif HTVA</th>
                <th class="py-4 px-6">Avec TVA 6% (+10 ans)</th>
              </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody class="divide-y divide-brand-border text-brand-darkText">
              <tr class="hover:bg-brand-surface/60 transition">
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold">Deplacement et diagnostic complet a Mouscron</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 text-brand-muted">30 a 45 min</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-navy">65 EUR</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-red">68.90 EUR</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-brand-surface/60 transition">
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold">Reparation fuite simple (joint, flexible, siphon)</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 text-brand-muted">Moins de 45 min</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-navy">Dès 95 EUR</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-red">Dès 100.70 EUR</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-brand-surface/60 transition">
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold">Debouchage d'urgence WC / Toilette</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 text-brand-muted">Immediat</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-navy">Dès 110 EUR</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-red">Dès 116.60 EUR</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-brand-surface/60 transition">
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold">Hydrocurage haute pression canalisation / egout</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 text-brand-muted">Sur rendez-vous express</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-navy">Dès 160 EUR</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-red">Dès 169.60 EUR</td>
              </tr>
              <tr class="hover:bg-brand-surface/60 transition">
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-semibold">Recherche de fuite non destructive avec camera</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 text-brand-muted">Sous 24h</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-navy">Dès 280 EUR</td>
                <td class="py-4 px-6 font-bold text-brand-red">Dès 296.80 EUR (Prise en charge assurance)</td>
